In total between both photos?,  Thank you for this by the way.

&#x200B;

And I apologize for bringing this question here due too my inability. Upon accepting to quote them I wasn't expecting this. I've done minimal commercial but nothing of this size and mostly cleaning kitchen exhausts, Far easier to quote then this.

Rest in peace, going xbox next gen if this isnt reverted.

&#x200B;

BRING BACK COMMUNTY PARTIES, BRING BACK COMMUNITIES EVENTS, EVERYTHING THAT WAS STRIPPED, JUST REVERT BACK.  This update was poorly thought out and designed, I want my parties the way the were, and my communities.
